# `agents.detail`

Full view-shaped agent detail — catalogs, permissions, harnesses, tags.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`AgentDetail` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `name` | `string` |
| `description` | `string` |
| `letter` | `string` |
| `icon` | `string` |
| `version` | `string` |
| `tags` | `string[]` |
| `skills` | `string[]` |
| `mcp_servers` | `string[]` |
| `rules` | `string[]` |
| `inline_rules` | `string` |
| `permissions_tier` | `string` |
| `permissions` | `map` |
| `source` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.detail --json '{ "id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "rust-lane",
  "name": "Rust Lane",
  "description": "Full Rust implementation lane — compiler, runtime, MCP server.",
  "letter": "R",
  "icon": "hammer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "tags": [
    "implementation"
  ],
  "skills": [
    "run",
    "verify"
  ],
